					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "https://httpbin.org/get",
							"protocol": "https",
							"host": [
								"httpbin",
								"org"
							],
							"path": [
								"get"
							]
						},
						"description": "🚨 SETUP REQUIRED BEFORE TESTING:\n\n1. **Start External Service**:\n   ```bash\n   docker-compose up -d backend-interview\n   ```\n\n2. **Start E-Wallet Backend**:\n   ```bash\n   npm run start:dev\n   ```\n\n3. **Verify Services**:\n   - E-Wallet API: http://localhost:8080\n   - External Service: http://localhost:3000\n   - External Service Docs: http://localhost:3000/doc\n\n4. **Environment Variables**:\n   Update .env file:\n   ```\n   EXTERNAL_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:3000\n   EXTERNAL_API_KEY=your-api-key\n   WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-webhook-secret\n   ```\n\n5. **Docker Configuration**:\n   Ensure docker-compose.yml has:\n   ```\n   WEBHOOK_URL=http://host.docker.internal:8080/topup/webhook\n   ```\n\n🎯 **Quick Start**: Run the \"🎯 Quick Demo Flow\" folder for an investor-ready demonstration!"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Important setup steps before running tests"
		},
		{
			"name": "🎯 Quick Demo Flow",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1. Register Demo User",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set('demo_api_key', jsonData.apiKey);",
									"    pm.environment.set('demo_user_id', jsonData.user.id);",
									"    pm.test('✅ User registered successfully', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData.user.username).to.eql('demo_investor');",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData.user.balance).to.eql(0);",
									"    });",
									"    console.log('🎉 Demo user created with ID:', jsonData.user.id);",
									"} else {",
									"    pm.test('❌ Registration failed', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201, 409]); // 409 if user exists",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"demo_investor\",\n  \"password\": \"SecureInvestorPass2024!\"\n}"
